# Anything here is excluded from the build context. Two reasons it matters:
# a host node_modules copied into the image would be the WRONG platform's native
# binaries (arm64 macOS vs linux/amd64), and the context is uploaded on every
# build, so a stale dist/ costs time on every push.

node_modules
**/node_modules

dist
**/dist
.angular
frontend/.angular

.git
.github
.gitignore

# Secrets never belong in an image layer. .env.example is fine and stays.
.env
**/.env
**/.env.local

# Planning docs and trackers change constantly and would bust the context cache
# for no benefit to a running container.
docs
*.md
!README.md

.vscode
**/.vscode
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# The scratch outputs of local tooling.
coverage
**/coverage
*.log
npm-debug.log*
